'''Commander Bun Bun''' (武将ぶんぶん, ''Bushō Bun Bun'', '''Commander Bun Bun''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] variant of [[Teacher Bun Bun]] introduced in 12th Anniversary stages. He was added in [[Version 14.0 Update|Version 14.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Commander Bun Bun
|image = E 706.png
|first appearance = [[Saikyo Domain]]
|money drop = 6,000¢ - 23,700¢
}}

==Enemy==
A gun-toting Bun Bun wearing a green jacket, with a mustache, beard and hair. Very similar to Teacher Bun Bun, but with higher health and damage and [[Omni Strike|Omni Strikes]] that pierce up to 280 range.

==Strategy==
The main issue of this enemy is similar to [[Mecha-Bun (Enemy)|Mecha-Bun]] in that he has only 200 range, but uses Omni Strike to reach much farther and even hit [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]], making lower-ranged specialists a less practical option. [[Shaman Cat (Rare Cat)|Necro-Dancer Cats]] can outrange his Omni Strikes and permafreeze him.

